          "docs": "Returns detailed information for a specific commit in a team's norms repository.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (bearer token)\n\n**Access Control:** User must be a member of the team.\n\n**Caching:** Responses are cached for 30 seconds.\n"
        },
        {
