          "docs": "Returns the diff between two references in a team's norms repository.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (bearer token)\n\n**Access Control:** User must be a member of the team.\n\n**Caching:** Responses are cached for 30 seconds.\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Check team context repository status",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/teams/:team_id/context-repo-status",
            "params": [
