          },
          "docs": "Returns non-sensitive git checkout information for debugging purposes.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (bearer token)\n\n**Access Control:** User must be a member of a team associated with the repository.\n\n**Security:** Intentionally excludes tokens and passwords.\n"
